And there is no individuality.

00:20:36.860 --> 00:20:37.800
There is only one thing.

00:20:38.520 --> 00:20:39.580
Total consensus.

00:20:39.580 --> 00:20:43.500
according to Haram B'Amm, according to Gemara, according to... If there was ever a

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:49.860
mahloket and something, that was not the Torah that we received from Moshe this night.

00:20:49.860 --> 00:20:54.040
That is the point of Haram B'Amm, makes it through and through. All the other things

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:58.540
we have called, that stand up, first on the right, not on the left, and so on and so on.

00:20:58.540 --> 00:21:09.380
All this according to Haram B'Amm is rabbinic, later. Alright? We Jews, we agree about

00:21:09.380 --> 00:21:13.180
the Moschot that we hear from Moshe Rabbeinu.

