00:22:54.500 --> 00:23:04.500
Although I know he's wrong, yes? But I should have the common sense to say, you know, he also has the right.

00:23:04.500 --> 00:23:12.500
And this is the way Hakamim behaved. My interpretation is my own. I present it to you.

00:23:12.500 --> 00:23:15.500
