00:55:21.320 --> 00:55:22.440
You could have read it as.

00:55:25.400 --> 00:55:28.520
Vowels are excluded from the consonant.

00:55:29.200 --> 00:55:33.540
Alphabetic means only consonant.

00:55:34.120 --> 00:55:35.620
No vowels.

